                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "85484944-ee97-3e81-af48-786700f8f622",
                        "entry_id": "d8eaac7f-7004-35f6-92e3-d8348bc05ccc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A mouth or aperture, such as of a tube, pipe, etc.; an opening."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c18d233b-0818-4d17-a873-5dd5c401c794",
                                "sense_id": "85484944-ee97-3e81-af48-786700f8f622",
                                "text": "the orifice of an artery or vein; the orifice of a wound; the vagina and other orifices"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e91a67f-5571-4771-b2c8-b825a4d1b14e",
                                "sense_id": "85484944-ee97-3e81-af48-786700f8f622",
                                "text": "For example, cultures that scorn open orifices of all kinds despise uninfibulated female genitals too[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "867049c6-42f2-47fd-b500-ea28f7c7a387",
                                "sense_id": "85484944-ee97-3e81-af48-786700f8f622",
                                "text": "As none of the ovicells were observed to be closed by the operculum, presumably because they were empty and the opercula were resting on the primary orifice rim, the ovicell closure type is subcleithral rather than cleithral [51 ], at least in some species of the genus."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3640e1e6-a974-38a3-962a-d314196615d4",
                        "entry_id": "d8eaac7f-7004-35f6-92e3-d8348bc05ccc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A stupid or objectionable person."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6eb40a34-8d07-4f6d-b318-9f15fed1f717",
                                "sense_id": "3640e1e6-a974-38a3-962a-d314196615d4",
                                "text": "“Peanuts aren't nuts, you orifice. They're legumes.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "43a82731-843d-416b-a981-12eee182eb20",
                        "source_entry_id": "d8eaac7f-7004-35f6-92e3-d8348bc05ccc",
                        "source_sense_description": "mouth or aperture, as of a tube, pipe",
                        "target_lang_word": "orifice",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "orifice",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f0a473a-066c-33d7-9378-decba902855f",
                                        "entry_id": "2223fcac-6c46-37d6-b443-d318f4207b01",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ouverture qui forme l’entrée de certaines excavations naturelles ou artificielles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9a12a46-ab90-4a29-ab7c-59f38fa5af0e",
                                                "sense_id": "1f0a473a-066c-33d7-9378-decba902855f",
                                                "text": "Les couches supérieures étant tout-à-fait meubles, il eût fallu un orifice très large à cette excavation pour que les éboulements ne la bouchassent pas en même temps qu'on la creusait."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40b1e9ec-0c1b-4e56-b509-dde00fb1f120",
                                                "sense_id": "1f0a473a-066c-33d7-9378-decba902855f",
                                                "text": "Après un tel paroxysme, l’éboulement des côtés du cratère obstrue encore plus l’orifice du volcan, et l’oblitère entièrement. On peut alors procéder à des observations […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5245eb66-28c8-4429-810a-0abb54b1a84f",
                                                "sense_id": "1f0a473a-066c-33d7-9378-decba902855f",
                                                "text": "Ce tunnel a son orifice inférieur à Modane, au nord, et l’orifice supérieur à Bardonnèche, au sud."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed8ffcfc-5d61-3dad-b082-71b157187cb9",
                                        "entry_id": "2223fcac-6c46-37d6-b443-d318f4207b01",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ouverture plus ou moins étroite qui sert d’entrée ou d’issue à certains organes, à certains appareils."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17619709-24f5-4112-9158-eb5af7efbb59",
                                                "sense_id": "ed8ffcfc-5d61-3dad-b082-71b157187cb9",
                                                "text": "Les orifices de l’estomac."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5be4df7-21f1-480c-ac09-10fa4cb0f4b7",
                                                "sense_id": "ed8ffcfc-5d61-3dad-b082-71b157187cb9",
                                                "text": "L’orifice d’un tuyau."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0036f5ad-6e7b-4004-94a2-6107b11ce1c3",
                                                "sense_id": "ed8ffcfc-5d61-3dad-b082-71b157187cb9",
                                                "text": "L’orifice d’une cornue."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
